docs/x-header-*.png
docs/facebook-cover-*.png
docs/youtube-banner-*.png

# Public repository. HANDOFF.md stays untracked.
# Write the handoff in agent-platform at handoffs/<repo>.md.
# CHANGELOG.private.md holds notes that must not be published.
HANDOFF.md
CHANGELOG.private.md
